          "text": "BUNDLE_START\n{\"path\":\"contact.html\",\"content\":\"<!doctype html>\\n<html lang=\\\"en\\\">\\n<head>\\n  <meta charset=\\\"utf-8\\\" />\\n  <meta name=\\\"viewport\\\" content=\\\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\\\" />\\n  <title>Contact — {{BUSINESS_NAME}}</title>\\n  <meta name=\\\"description\\\" content=\\\"Connect with {{BUSINESS_NAME}} for sensory, premium sound bath experiences. Inquire or book a session in {{CITY}}, {{STATE}}.\\\" />\\n  <style>\\n    :root{\\n      --bg-start:#0f1724; --bg-end:#0b1220; --glass:rgba(255,255,255,0.06); --glass-2:rgba(255,255,255,0.04);\\n      --accent:#9be7e7; --muted:#cbd5e1; --card:#0b1220; --radius:16px;\\n      --glass-border:rgba(255,255,255,0.08);\\n      --shadow: 0 8px 30px rgba(2,6,23,0.6);\\n      font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial;\\n    }\\n    html,body{height:100%;margin:0;background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--bg-start),var(--bg-end));color:var(--muted);}\\n    /* patterned backdrop using external svg file for a layered feel */\\n    body::before{\\n      content:\\\"\\\";position:fixed;inset:0;z-index:0;opacity:0.18;background-image:url('assets/img/pattern.svg');background-size:1800px;mix-blend-mode:screen;filter:blur(6px) saturate(1.1);\\n    }\\n    .page{position:relative;z-index:1;min-height:100vh;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:40px;padding:48px;box-sizing:border-box;}\\n    header{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:20px}\\n    .brand{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px}\\n    .logo{width:56px;height:56px;border-radius:12px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--accent),#7be3e3);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;color:#032;box-shadow:var(--shadow);font-weight:700}\\n    nav{display:flex;gap:14px;align-items:center}\\n    a.navlink{color:var(--muted);text-decoration:none;padding:8px 12px;border-radius:10px;font-size:14px}\\n    a.navlink:hover{background:var(--glass);border:1px solid var(--glass-border);color:white}\\n\\n    /* hero */\\n    .hero{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 420px;gap:36px;align-items:center}\\n    .hero-card{background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(255,255,255,0.02),transparent);border-radius:var(--radius);padding:32px;backdrop-filter:blur(8px) saturate(1.1);border:1px solid var(--glass-border);box-shadow:var(--shadow)}\\n    h1{color:#fff;margin:0;font-size:34px;line-height:1.05}\\n    p.lead{color:var(--muted);margin-top:12px}\\n    .cta-row{display:flex;gap:12px;margin-top:20px}\\n    .btn{padding:12px 16px;border-radius:12px;border:none;cursor:pointer;font-weight:600}\\n    .btn-primary{background:linear-gradient(90deg,var(--accent),#76e3e3);color:#012;}\\n    .btn-ghost{background:transparent;border:1px solid var(--glass-border;color:var(--muted);}\\n\\n    /* info column */\\n    .info{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:12px}\\n    .meta{display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:center}\\n    .meta .dot{width:10px;height:10px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--accent)}\\n\\n    /* sections */\\n    section{background:linear-gradient(180deg,var(--glass),var(--glass-2));border-radius:16px;padding:22px;border:1px solid var(--glass-border);}\\n    .two{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:18px}\\n    ul.clean{list-style:none;margin:0;padding:0;display:grid;gap:8px}\\n    .pill{display:inline-block;padding:6px 10px;border-radius:999px;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.03);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.03);color:var(--muted);font-size:13px}\\n\\n    .form{display:grid;gap:12px}\\n    input[type=\\\"text\\\"],input[type=\\\"email\\\"],textarea,select{background:transparent;border:1px solid var(--glass-border);padding:12px;border-radius:10px;color:var(--muted);outline:none}\\n    textarea{min-height:120px}\\n    .muted{color:#98a3af;font-size:13px}\\n\\n    footer{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;padding-top:6px;color:#9aa6b0;font-size:13px}\\n\\n    /* testimonials */\\n    .test-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:12px}\\n    .quote{padding:16px;border-radius:12px;background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(255,255,255,0.02),transparent);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.03)}\\n\\n    @media (max-width:900px){\\n      .hero{grid-template-columns:1fr;}\\n      .two{grid-template-columns:1fr}\\n      .test-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}\\n    }\\n  </style>\\n</head>\\n<body>\\n  <div class=\\\"page\\\">\\n    <header>\\n      <div class=\\\"brand\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"logo\\\">SB</div>\\n        <div>\\n          <div style=\\\"font-weight:700;color:#fff\\\">{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</div>\\n          <div style=\\\"font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)\\\">{{TAGLINE}}</div>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n      <nav aria-label=\\\"Primary navigation\\\">\\n        <a class=\\\"navlink\\\" href=\\\"index.html\\\">Home</a>\\n        <a class=\\\"navlink\\\" href=\\\"events.html\\\">Upcoming</a>\\n        <a class=\\\"navlink\\\" href=\\\"private-sessions.html\\\">Private</a>\\n        <a class=\\\"navlink\\\" href=\\\"pricing.html\\\">Rates</a>\\n        <a class=\\\"navlink\\\" href=\\\"about.html\\\">About</a>\\n        <a class=\\\"navlink\\\" href=\\\"book.html\\\">Reserve</a>\\n        <a class=\\\"navlink\\\" href=\\\"contact.html\\\" aria-current=\\\"page\\\">Connect</a>\\n      </nav>\\n    </header>\\n\\n    <!-- HERO -->\\n    <main class=\\\"hero\\\">\\n      <div class=\\\"hero-card\\\">\\n        <h1>Connect with resonance — book a session or ask a question</h1>\\n        <p class=\\\"lead\\\">Our approach blends careful intention, clinical calm facilitation, and premium sound textures. Reach out about drop-in events, 1:1 or hybrid packages in {{CITY}}, {{STATE}}.</p>\\n        <div class=\\\"cta-row\\\">\\n          <a class=\\\"btn btn-primary\\\" href=\\\"{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}\\\">{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</a>\\n          <a class=\\\"btn\\\" style=\\\"background:transparent;border:1px solid var(--glass-border);color:var(--muted);\\\" href=\\\"book.html\\\">See availability</a>\\n        </div>\\n        <div style=\\\"margin-top:18px;display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:center;flex-wrap:wrap\\\">\\n          <div class=\\\"pill\\\">Facilitator: {{FACILITATOR_NAME}}</div>\\n          <div class=\\\"pill\\\">Venue: {{VENUE_NAME}}</div>\\n          <div class=\\\"pill\\\">Next event: {{NEXT_EVENT_DATE}}</div>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n\\n      <aside class=\\\"hero-card info\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"meta\\\"><span class=\\\"dot\\\"></span><div><strong style=\\\"color:#fff\\\">Contact</strong><div class=\\\"muted\\\">We reply within 48 hours</div></div></div>\\n        <div style=\\\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:6px;margin-top:10px\\\">\\n          <div><strong>Phone</strong><div class=\\\"muted\\\">{{PHONE}}</div></div>\\n          <div><strong>Email</strong><div class=\\\"muted\\\">{{EMAIL}}</div></div>\\n        </div>\\n        <div style=\\\"margin-top:12px\\\">\\n          <strong>Location</strong>\\n          <div class=\\\"muted\\\">{{VENUE_NAME}} — {{CITY}}, {{STATE}}</div>\\n        </div>\\n      </aside>\\n    </main>\\n\\n    <!-- STORY -->\\n    <section aria-labelledby=\\\"story\\\">\\n      <h2 id=\\\"story\\\" style=\\\"color:#fff;margin:0 0 8px 0\\\">A short note — why it feels premium</h2>\\n      <p class=\\\"muted\\\">Our sessions are designed for gentle sensory recalibration. We combine nuanced frequencies, intentional pacing, and a calm, clinical touch. This lets you sink into sound without excess stimulation — a curated environment for recalibration and rest.</p>\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <!-- FRAMEWORK (flow) -->\\n    <section aria-labelledby=\\\"flow\\\" class=\\\"two\\\">\\n      <div>\\n        <h3 id=\\\"flow\\\" style=\\\"color:#fff;margin-top:0\\\">Session flow — what to expect</h3>\\n        <ul class=\\\"clean\\\">\\n          <li><strong>Arrival & grounding</strong> — brief intake, choice of soft lighting and positioning.</li>\\n          <li><strong>Intention & breath</strong> — guided breathing and gentle prompts to orient the nervous system.</li>\\n          <li><strong>Sound immersion</strong> — a layered set of instruments played with space and restraint.</li>\\n          <li><strong>Integration</strong> — soft silence and a short check-in to transition back.</li>\\n        </ul>\\n        <p class=\\\"muted\\\" style=\\\"margin-top:8px\\\">Typical session length: 60–90 minutes. We prioritize safety and a predictable arc so guests feel secure throughout.</p>\\n      </div>\\n      <div>\\n        <h3 style=\\\"color:#fff;margin-top:0\\\">Instruments & textural palette</h3>\\n        <p class=\\\"muted\\\">Our curated palette prioritizes clarity and harmonic richness. A recent set may include:</p>\\n        <ul class=\\\"clean\\\">\\n          <li>Monochord: slow, sympathetic vibrations that underpin tone.</li>\\n          <li>Crystal singing bowls: clear, high sustain notes for spaciousness.</li>\\n          <li>Wind chimes & koshi: subtle high-frequency sparkles.</li>\\n          <li>Tuning forks: focused therapeutic tones for precise entrainment.</li>\\n          <li>Soft frame drum: a low tactile anchor when gently applied.</li>\\n        </ul>\\n      </div>\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <!-- OFFERS -->\\n    <section aria-labelledby=\\\"offers\\\">\\n      <h3 id=\\\"offers\\\" style=\\\"color:#fff;margin-top:0\\\">Offerings — hybrid models for flexibility</h3>\\n      <div class=\\\"two\\\">\\n        <div>\\n          <h4 style=\\\"margin:0;color:#fff\\\">Community sound baths</h4>\\n          <p class=\\\"muted\\\">Drop-in evenings: a shared group field. Great for first-timers and communal resonance.</p>\\n        </div>\\n        <div>\\n          <h4 style=\\\"margin:0;color:#fff\\\">Private & hybrid packages</h4>\\n          <p class=\\\"muted\\\">1:1 sessions, couples, and corporate offerings that combine in-person sound with remote-guided materials when needed.</p>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <!-- PRICING (overview) -->\\n    <section aria-labelledby=\\\"pricing-overview\\\">\\n      <h3 id=\\\"pricing-overview\\\" style=\\\"color:#fff;margin-top:0\\\">A quick pricing guide</h3>\\n      <div class=\\\"two\\\" style=\\\"align-items:start\\\">\\n        <div>\\n          <div style=\\\"background:linear-gradient(90deg,#071226,rgba(255,255,255,0.02));padding:12px;border-radius:12px\\\">\\n            <strong style=\\\"color:#fff\\\">Community drop-in</strong>\\n            <div class=\\\"muted\\\">$30 — single session</div>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n        <div>\\n          <div style=\\\"background:linear-gradient(90deg,#071226,rgba(255,255,255,0.02));padding:12px;border-radius:12px\\\">\\n            <strong style=\\\"color:#fff\\\">Private 1:1</strong>\\n            <div class=\\\"muted\\\">$120 — 60 min | $180 — 90 min</div>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n      <p class=\\\"muted\\\" style=\\\"margin-top:8px\\\">Customized packages available for couples and corporate retreats. Contact us for a tailored proposal.</p>\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <!-- TESTIMONIALS -->\\n    <section aria-labelledby=\\\"testimonials\\\">\\n      <h3 id=\\\"testimonials\\\" style=\\\"color:#fff;margin-top:0\\\">What people notice</h3>\\n      <div class=\\\"test-grid\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"quote\\\">\\n          <div style=\\\"font-weight:700;color:#fff\\\">\\\"A measured, luxurious practice — I left calmer than I expected.\\\"</div>\\n          <div class=\\\"muted\\\">— A. M., attendee</div>\\n        </div>\\n        <div class=\\\"quote\\\">\\n          <div style=\\\"font-weight:700;color:#fff\\\">\\\"Clinical calm paired with deep sound. The facilitator holds a safe space.\\\"</div>\\n          <div class=\\\"muted\\\">— R. P., private client</div>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <!-- CALL TO ACTION & CONTACT FORM -->\\n    <section aria-labelledby=\\\"contact\\\">\\n      <h3 id=\\\"contact\\\" style=\\\"color:#fff;margin-top:0\\\">Get in touch or secure your spot</h3>\\n      <div class=\\\"two\\\">\\n        <div>\\n          <form class=\\\"form\\\" action=\\\"{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}\\\" method=\\\"POST\\\" aria-label=\\\"Contact form\\\">\\n            <label class=\\\"muted\\\">Full name\\n              <input type=\\\"text\\\" name=\\\"name\\\" placeholder=\\\"Your name\\\" required />\\n            </label>\\n            <label class=\\\"muted\\\">Email\\n              <input type=\\\"email\\\" name=\\\"email\\\" placeholder=\\\"you@example.com\\\" required />\\n            </label>\\n            <label class=\\\"muted\\\">Type of request\\n              <select name=\\\"type\\\">\\n                <option>General inquiry</option>\\n                <option>Drop-in event</option>\\n                <option>Private 1:1</option>\\n                <option>Corporate / Group</option>\\n              </select>\\n            </label>\\n            <label class=\\\"muted\\\">Message\\n              <textarea name=\\\"message\\\" placeholder=\\\"Let us know what you're interested in...\\\"></textarea>\\n            </label>\\n            <div style=\\\"display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:center\\\">\\n              <button class=\\\"btn btn-primary\\\" type=\\\"submit\\\">Send request</button>\\n              <div class=\\\"muted\\\">or call <a href=\\\"tel:{{PHONE}}\\\" style=\\\"color:var(--accent);text-decoration:none\\\">{{PHONE}}</a></div>\\n            </div>\\n          </form>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        <div>\\n          <h4 style=\\\"color:#fff;margin-top:0\\\">Practical essentials</h4>\\n          <p class=\\\"muted\\\"><strong>What to bring:</strong> a yoga mat or blanket, a small pillow, water, and any props you prefer. We provide bolsters and extra blankets on request.</p>\\n\\n          <p class=\\\"muted\\\"><strong>Contraindications & safety:</strong> If you are pregnant, have uncontrolled epilepsy, recent head injury, or are under heavy influence of sedatives, please contact us before booking. Sound practices can be powerful; we screen for safety and adapt to medical needs.</p>\\n\\n          <p class=\\\"muted\\\"><strong>Accessibility:</strong> venue accessibility varies by site — call or email with specific needs and we will accommodate where possible.</p>\\n\\n          <div style=\\\"margin-top:10px\\\">\\n            <strong style=\\\"color:#fff\\\">Map & arrival</strong>\\n            <div class=\\\"muted\\\">Please arrive 10–15 minutes early. Street parking usually available near {{VENUE_NAME}}.</div>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <footer>\\n      <div>© <span style=\\\"font-weight:700\\\">{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</span> — made for calm. <span class=\\\"muted\\\">{{CITY}}, {{STATE}}</span></div>\\n      <div class=\\\"muted\\\">Questions? <a href=\\\"mailto:{{EMAIL}}\\\" style=\\\"color:var(--accent);text-decoration:none\\\">{{EMAIL}}</a></div>\\n    </footer>\\n  </div>\\n  <!-- gentle decorative SVG to layer with the page background -->\\n  <svg width=\\\"0\\\" height=\\\"0\\\" style=\\\"position:absolute\\\">\\n    <defs>\\n      <filter id=\\\"softGlow\\\"><feGaussianBlur stdDeviation=\\\"12\\\" result=\\\"b\\\"/></filter>\\n    </defs>\\n  </svg>\\n</body>\\n</html>\"} \n{\"path\":\"README.md\",\"content\":\"Project: Sound Bath Site — chunk 4\\n\\nFiles included in this bundle:\\n- contact.html  -> Contact and information page for {{BUSINESS_NAME}}\\n- README.md     -> This file\\n\\nPurpose\\nThis chunk provides the contact page for the sound bath site. The page follows the \\\"glass_morphism\\\" layout family and uses a \\\"clinical_calm\\\" voice — concise, clear, and reassuring. The offer model is \\\"hybrid\\\" (community drop-ins + private/hybrid packages).\\n\\nStructure of contact.html\\n- Header with nav. Labels vary (e.g., \\\"Upcoming\\\" not \\\"Events\\\") to maintain unique nav voice across the project.\\n- Hero: CTA with placeholders ({{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}, {{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}), facilitator and venue quick facts.\\n- Story: premium sensory description.\\n- Framework: explicit session flow (arrival, breath, sound immersion, integration).\\n- Offers: brief overview of community and private offerings.\\n- Pricing: quick pricing guide for transparency.\\n- Testimonials: two short quotes.\\n- CTA/Contact form: name, email, type, message; posts to {{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}.\\n- Practical essentials: \\\"what to bring\\\", contraindications disclaimer, accessibility and arrival notes.\\n\\nPlaceholders to replace\\n- {{BUSINESS_NAME}}, {{TAGLINE}}, {{PHONE}}, {{EMAIL}}, {{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}, {{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}, {{CITY}}, {{STATE}}, {{FACILITATOR_NAME}}, {{VENUE_NAME}}, {{NEXT_EVENT_DATE}}\\n\\nDesign notes\\n- Visual richness is achieved with CSS gradients, glass morphism, and an external SVG tiled pattern at assets/img/pattern.svg (referenced by the page). Create a unique assets/img/pattern.svg and place it in the project root assets folder.\\n- No external fonts, images, or CDNs are referenced.\\n- Keep the voice clinical and calm: short paragraphs, clear safety notes, and precise session flow.\\n\\nAccessibility\\n- Form elements are labeled. Links use semantic anchors. Use ARIA labels if you add complex interactive widgets.\\n\\nCustomization\\n- Replace placeholders across the file.\\n- Adjust pricing and offerings as needed.\\n- To change the primary CTA destination, update {{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}.\\n\\nDeveloper reminders\\n- The page references assets/img/pattern.svg; ensure you add a bespoke SVG pattern there to maintain the intended layered background look.\\n- If you split CSS into a separate file, preserve the glass and gradient variables and the body::before background layering.\\n\\nRevision details\\n- Layout family: glass_morphism\\n- Voice family: clinical_calm\\n- Offer model: hybrid\\n\\nEnd of README\"} \nBUNDLE_END"
